      "category": "tinyxml2",
      "signature": "QueryIntAttribute(Target, Name, Value)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "TINYXML2_LIB*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Name",
          "type": "char*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Value",
          "type": "Int*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "XMLError",
      "docs": "Given an attribute name, QueryIntAttribute() returns\nXML_SUCCESS, XML_WRONG_ATTRIBUTE_TYPE if the conversion\ncan't be performed, or XML_NO_ATTRIBUTE if the attribute\ndoesn't exist. If successful, the result of the conversion\nwill be written to 'value'. If not successful, nothing will\nbe written to 'value'. This allows you to provide default\nvalue:\n@verbatim\nint value = 10;\nQueryIntAttribute( \"foo\", &value );\t\t// if \"foo\" isn't found, value will still be 10\n@endverbatim"
    },
